\f0\fs28\b ReaBattery\b0\fs22\par
Battery indicator for the REAPER Transport Bar. Currently only for Apple Silicon macOS.\par
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Helvetica;}}
\f0\fs28\b ReaBattery\b0\fs22\par
Shows battery level and charging status in the docked Transport Bar. Configure percentage, position, fullscreen visibility and visibility on external power from Extensions > ReaBattery.\par
}
